<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Add Gift Card | Air Asia</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css"></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="site-header"><div class="header-inner"><a class="brand" href="card-list.php" aria-label="Air Asia Rewards gift cards"><span class="brand-mark">AirAsia</span><span><strong>Air Asia Rewards</strong><small>Gift Card Redemption</small></span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="card-list.php">Gift Cards</a><a href="login.php">Sign out</a></nav></div></header><main id="main"><a class="back-link" href="card-list.php">← Back to Gift Cards</a><div class="form-layout"><section class="panel form-panel"><span class="eyebrow">GIFT CARD MANAGEMENT</span><h1>Add Gift Card</h1><p class="muted">Enter the details for a new gift card. All fields are required.</p><form action="card-list.php" method="get"><div class="field"><label for="card-name">Card Name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="card-name" name="cardName" type="text" maxlength="100" placeholder="Enter gift card name" required></div><div class="field"><label for="card-type">Card Type <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><select id="card-type" name="cardType" required><option value="" disabled selected>Select card type</option><option value="Retail">Retail</option><option value="Dining">Dining</option><option value="Entertainment">Entertainment</option><option value="Travel">Travel</option></select></div><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="card-value">Card Value (USD) <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="card-value" name="cardValue" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" placeholder="25.00" required></div><div class="field"><label for="points">Points Required <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="points" name="points" type="number" min="1" step="1" placeholder="2000" required></div></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button" type="submit">Add Gift Card</button><a class="button secondary" href="card-list.php">Cancel</a></div></form><p class="demo-note">This demo returns to the gift card list. Changes are not saved.</p></section><aside class="form-aside"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SOMETHING EXTRA</span><h2>Great rewards start here.</h2><img src="images/gift-card.png" alt="Red rewards gift card"><p>Give every reward a clear name, category, value, and points requirement.</p></aside></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><span>Air Asia Rewards Redemption System</span><span>IS 6465 · Static coursework prototype</span></footer></body></html>
